# This tool mints and handles live GitHub credentials — require the owner's
# review on anything that resolves, signs, or mints a token, plus the
# installer/setup path and repo policy itself. package.json and test/ define what
# the required `test` check runs, so they get the same review as the code it gates.
# Mirrors .github/ai-policy.yml's risk.human_required_paths.
/src/           @noneedinmagic
/bin/           @noneedinmagic
/scripts/       @noneedinmagic
/.github/       @noneedinmagic
/package.json   @noneedinmagic
/test/          @noneedinmagic
